<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 02:09:26 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>独家：南希·佩洛西和迈克·彭斯在美国领导层面前深情拥抱的房间内</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/16/nancy-pelosi-mike-pence-embrace-award-yale-ceo-caucus/</link><description>耶鲁大学管理学教授杰夫·索南菲尔德（Jeff Sonnenfeld）告诉《财富》杂志，这“对所有人来说都是令人震惊的、具有历史意义的、令人激动的”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/20260915_yale_253-1-e1789595920279.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 22:08:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/16/nancy-pelosi-mike-pence-embrace-award-yale-ceo-caucus/</guid></item><item><title>Gap 的新策略：减少折扣，增加 Hailey Bieber</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/gap-hailey-bieber-strategy-richard-dickson/</link><description>Gap 的销量正在改善，但其卷土重来仍然是一个“给我看”的故事。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2181045659-e1787885319819.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/gap-hailey-bieber-strategy-richard-dickson/</guid></item><item><title>Salesforce 的马克·贝尼奥夫 (Marc Benioff) 对人工智能行业表示：自我监管，否则就会被起诉</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/16/salesforce-marc-benioff-interview-dreamforce-ai-industry-regulate-yourselves-or-get-sued/</link><description>这位直言不讳的首席执行官本周将在旧金山主持公司年度 Dreamforce 会议。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2294931541.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 21:48:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/16/salesforce-marc-benioff-interview-dreamforce-ai-industry-regulate-yourselves-or-get-sued/</guid></item><item><title>“让美国人民对人工智能的发展有发言权”：Alex Bores 成立了一家耗资 3000 万美元的非营利组织，致力于监管人工智能</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/15/alex-bores-who-decides-ai-policy-democratic-party/</link><description>亚历克斯·博雷斯（Alex Bores）告诉《财富》杂志，奥弗顿之窗是敞开的：“即使是被问到的问题也是可以争夺的。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2278315098-e1789492873957.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 20:00:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/15/alex-bores-who-decides-ai-policy-democratic-party/</guid></item><item><title>沃什鹰派新闻发布会后股市跌至7月以来最低水平</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/16/warsh-fed-hike-ai-hyperscalers-treasury-yields/</link><description>标准普尔 500 指数下跌 1%，道指下跌 1.7%，因美联储主席在周三加息前表示利率不会受到限制。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2295045198-e1789593101656.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 21:23:29 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/16/warsh-fed-hike-ai-hyperscalers-treasury-yields/</guid></item><item><title>人工智能的领导者有一个问题：他们害怕他们想要赢得的比赛</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/ai-leaders-problem-sam-altman-fear-race-openai/</link><description>人工智能领导者警告说，这场竞赛是危险的。他们也在努力赢得胜利。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/altmanaly.webp?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 11:40:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/ai-leaders-problem-sam-altman-fear-race-openai/</guid></item><item><title>薪资高，需求量大，无人接盘。美国贸易短缺背后的地位问题。</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/14/good-pay-high-demand-no-takers-the-status-problem-behind-americas-trades-shortage/</link><description>退休、过时的观念和缺乏职业意识使得技术行业的紧缺职位更难填补。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-1500686570-e1789146349811.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 12:20:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/14/good-pay-high-demand-no-takers-the-status-problem-behind-americas-trades-shortage/</guid></item><item><title>Sam Altman 表示，他喜欢通过观看 5 到 10 分钟的 TikTok 风格的短片来放松，但也承认多巴胺激增对孩子来说是“危险的”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/16/openai-ceo-sam-altman-scrolls-on-tiktok-short-form-video-relax-before-bed-but-dangerous-for-gen-alpha/</link><description>OpenAI 的亿万富翁首席执行官萨姆·奥尔特曼 (Sam Altman) 喜欢在睡前浏览 TikTok，而且他并不是唯一这样做的首席执行官。但他不让他的儿子使用该应用程序。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2294954764-e1789569389915.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 15:07:53 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/16/openai-ceo-sam-altman-scrolls-on-tiktok-short-form-video-relax-before-bed-but-dangerous-for-gen-alpha/</guid></item><item><title>人工智能特工正在变得流氓。首席信息官们正在竞相在他们周围设置护栏</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/16/ai-agents-are-going-rogue-cios-are-racing-to-put-guardrails-around-them/</link><description>随着人工智能代理承担更多的工作并带来新的风险，思科、Intuit、Workday 和 ServiceNow 正在创建监督层来监视、管理和遏制它们。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/CIO-Intelligence-Sept-2026.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 16:49:27 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/16/ai-agents-are-going-rogue-cios-are-racing-to-put-guardrails-around-them/</guid></item><item><title>男子因诈骗特拉维斯·凯尔斯 3500 万美元的庞氏骗局而被判刑：“他这样做是出于贪婪”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/16/travis-kelce-victim-fraud-ponzi-scheme-sentencing-35-million/</link><description>他还要求在狱中与未婚夫结婚。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2244346396-e1789589503703.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 20:44:02 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/16/travis-kelce-victim-fraud-ponzi-scheme-sentencing-35-million/</guid></item></channel></rss>